## 3. Functional Requirements

### 3.1 Real-time Detection Engine
**Must-have capabilities:**

- **Multi-format Support:**
  - Images: PNG, JPEG, BMP, TIFF, GIF, WebP
  - Documents: PDF, DOC/DOCX, XLS/XLSX, PPT/PPTX
  - Audio: WAV, MP3, FLAC, OGG
  - Video: MP4, AVI, MKV, MOV
  - Archives: ZIP, RAR, 7Z

- **Detection Algorithms:**
  - LSB (Least Significant Bit) analysis across all bit planes
  - DCT coefficient analysis for JPEG images
  - Statistical anomaly detection (Chi-square, RS analysis)
  - Frequency domain analysis for audio/video
  - File structure anomaly detection
  - Machine learning-based pattern recognition

- **Real-time Processing:**
  - Process files < 10MB within 2 seconds
  - Handle throughput of 1000+ files per minute
  - Queue management for larger files (up to 100MB)
  - Parallel processing across multiple detection engines

### 3.2 Network Integration & Blocking
**Core network capabilities:**

- **Network Tap Integration:**
  - Monitor HTTP/HTTPS traffic (with SSL/TLS inspection)
  - Email attachment scanning (SMTP/IMAP/POP3)
  - File transfer protocol monitoring (FTP/SFTP/SCP)
  - Cloud storage API monitoring (Google Drive, Dropbox, OneDrive)

- **Automatic Blocking:**
  - Real-time content blocking based on suspicion scores
  - Configurable threat level thresholds (Low/Medium/High/Critical)
  - Whitelist/blacklist management for users and file types
  - Quarantine suspicious files for manual review

- **Alert System:**
  - Real-time notifications via SIEM integration
  - Email/SMS alerts for high-priority threats
  - Webhook integration for custom response systems
  - Detailed incident reports with forensic metadata

### 3.3 Encoding/Decoding Laboratory
**Research and testing capabilities:**

- **Advanced Encoding:**
  - Multiple LSB depths (1-8 bits per channel)
  - DCT-based JPEG steganography
  - PVD (Pixel Value Differencing) techniques
  - F5 algorithm implementation
  - Audio LSB and phase coding
  - PDF metadata and structure manipulation

- **Payload Management:**
  - Text messages with multiple encodings (UTF-8, ASCII, Base64)
  - Binary file embedding with compression (ZIP/GZIP)
  - Multi-file payload splitting across multiple carriers
  - Encrypted payloads (AES-256, ChaCha20)
  - Error correction codes (Reed-Solomon, BCH)

- **Stealth Features:**
  - Password-based key derivation (PBKDF2, Argon2)
  - Pseudo-random pixel/sample ordering
  - Anti-detection countermeasures
  - Traffic pattern obfuscation
  - Timing-based covert channels

### 3.4 Analysis & Forensics Tools
**Investigation capabilities:**

- **Visual Analysis:**
  - Bit-plane visualization and analysis
  - Statistical distribution histograms
  - Frequency spectrum analysis
  - Pixel difference heatmaps
  - LSB extraction previews

- **Automated Analysis:**
  - Entropy calculation and anomaly scoring
  - Header/metadata inconsistency detection
  - File signature validation
  - Compression ratio analysis
  - Temporal pattern recognition

- **Reporting:**
  - Detailed forensic reports with evidence chains
  - Export capabilities (PDF, JSON, XML)
  - Integration with forensic tool suites
  - Chain-of-custody documentation

