## 7. Detection Algorithms & Techniques

### 7.1 Statistical Analysis
- **Chi-square Test:** Detect LSB embedding through statistical deviation
- **RS Analysis:** Identify spatial domain steganography
- **Sample Pair Analysis:** Advanced statistical detection method
- **Weighted Stego Analysis:** Multi-bit LSB detection

### 7.2 Machine Learning Approaches
- **Deep Neural Networks:** Trained on known steganographic samples
- **Support Vector Machines:** Classification of suspicious patterns
- **Random Forest:** Ensemble method for robust detection
- **Anomaly Detection:** Unsupervised learning for unknown techniques

### 7.3 Format-Specific Detection
- **JPEG:** DCT coefficient analysis, double compression detection
- **PNG:** Palette analysis, chunk structure validation
- **PDF:** Object stream analysis, metadata anomalies
- **Audio:** Spectral analysis, phase relationships
- **Video:** Motion vector analysis, frame correlation

